### Step 1: Add a Binary Feature for Identifying a Flush Hand
python
# Feature name: is_flush
# Feature description: Determines if all five cards have the same suit.
# Usefulness: Flush, Straight Flush, and Royal Flush hands require all five cards to have the same suit. This binary feature simplifies the model's ability to identify these hands.

